ource_hash":"61e3cdaa9876d6c27fb3addcdc3c5faa44279401e839f99d667066c449de8eee","text":"第三条（修改其他法律）① 省略\n\n  ② 国家退伍军人事务委员会条例部分内容修改如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00039","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010074-287477-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4508,"end":4686,"target_id":"fbd2203d5838134e2f40674cd7f32353da6c368831045577a679562d335f71dc","source_hash":"930c43bac5c5d80f640ae853db2d21738780359514e0be34231e28b32aa7fca4","text":"  第二条各款规定如下。\n\n    1. 经济财政部\n\n    2. 教育部\n\n    3. 国防部\n\n    4. 安全与公共管理部\n\n    5. 文化、体育和旅游部\n\n    6. 贸易、工业和能源部\n\n    7. 卫生福利部\n\n    8. 雇佣劳动部\n\n    9. 国土交通部\n\n    10. 政府政策协调办公室\n\n  ③ 至 ⑦ 省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00040","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010074-287477-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4686,"end":4738,"target_id":"4a7c93428fb0c5fabbd9fa4ff5d359630636b4f0cbf4c835bcfa54f53e62ed0e","source_hash":"d9f01cc814eecd720e719c99036fceec3e0c0b9c1204a01cbb58a1b1bc1ed803","text":"补充规定 <第24836号，2013年11月5日>\n\n本法令自2013年11月14日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00041","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010074-287477-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4738,"end":4781,"target_id":"ecc7589ccfa97f27ef9c45326e99675592e26c4cc7ef6b925c1c7c457de200e6","source_hash":"a3c47358b5319a3ba45787da785dfea890df8d8d79398cc9047d30e04f9d9dac","text":"增编（政府行政和内政部及其附属机构的组织结构）<2014年11月19日第25751号>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00042","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010074-287477-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4781,"end":4906,"target_id":"50132aa86cd96f9af09836f87ac5ccd566df5840fbad405ffb9fe3ad01b80d6c","source_hash":"ecc5937743f918230a397055273a1cd44275217a8341699c9b3693e458eb6e4c","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。但是，根据补充法令第五条修正的总统令中，修正在本法令生效前已公布但生效日期尚未到来的总统令的部分，应自相关总统令各自的生效日期起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00043","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010074-287477-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4906,"end":4923,"target_id":"28a532598cc0e9ec15641f5c1c4d6f3e5d2c4b21046601c97f36c375448669e3","source_hash":"6ffda08faf109c176be482db4409396ced46b0373db22ad766c9b45cca3b755a","text":"省略第 2 至 4 条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00044","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010074-287477-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4923,"en